# TRIAD source manifest (24 September 2026)
#
# The implementation files listed below are the controller sources of TRIAD: the
# V1 finite-plan controller, the V2 receding receiver with its
# robot-independent giver, the supervisory-mode interception solver and grasp supervisor, the
# repair-branch fixes, and the two-robot giver coordinator with its two states.
#
# The frozen V1 background-planning state (f56add3) is still pinned by
# docs/source_sync_f56add3.sha256; those files are preserved byte-identically at
# commit ebaedfa (the last V1-only main) and at tag csi-2026-release, which the
# workflow verifies with tools/verify_frozen_v1_preserved.sh. On this tree the
# V1 default path is checked by the Dataset-B scenario-identity tests instead.
#
# Verify with:
#   sha256sum -c docs/source_sync_triad-2026-09-24.sha256
#
